		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Malicious shadowy boulder with one eye and long, ropey black tendrils.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 31, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 tendril (double near) +4 (grab + <strong>S</strong>TR drain) and 1 bite +4 (2d8), <strong>MV</strong> close (climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or target trapped in tendril. Tendril autohits target next round. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>One With Shadow</strong>. While in dim light or darkness, only damaged by magical sources. STR Drain. Target takes 1d6 STR damage. Paralyzed at 0 STR.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pull</strong>. In place of a tendril attack, pull a grabbed target a near distance.</p><p></p><p><strong>Tendrils</strong>. Four total. AC 18 each. 4+ damage to one severs it.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
